# Line-ending policy: the repository stores every text file as LF, and
# checkout keeps LF on ALL platforms. The explicit `eol=lf` takes precedence
# over any local `core.autocrlf=true`, so a fresh Windows clone passes
# `pnpm format:check` (prettier endOfLine: lf) without per-developer git
# configuration.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
# (None are currently tracked; declared so future assets cannot break the
# text policy.)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.tar binary
